村嚭鏉ョ殑妤氬噷鏄�鍚�鍒拌繖浼犻椈涔嬪悗锛屾�掍簡锛�", "妤氱帀杞╋紝浣犳暍閫犺埃璐ュ潖鎴戠殑鍚嶅０锛�", "浜庢槸涔庯紝闀囧浗鍏�涓诲紑濮嬩簡娲楀啢涔嬭矾锛岃�嶈捣浜嗘祦姘撯�︹��"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "爷太残暴", "content_zh": "卷一 摄政风云 001 她是狼女残阳如血，血腥弥漫与空中，血流成河的草地与斜阳交辉呼应，红光一片，偶尔传来几声胡雁哀鸣，本是人迹罕至之地，如今确是尸横遍野，一眼望去触目惊心。李影顿觉浑身无力，入骨的疼痛蔓延全身，鼻翼间充斥着浓烈的血腥味。她向来警惕，尤其是遇到危险时。猛地睁开双眼，漆黑的眸子如冰魄般碎出锐利的冷光，大片的红映入眼帘，残骸遍布，血流成河。这是哪？难道是地狱？她嘴角微起，若真是地狱，总好过人间炼狱。“嗯。”她闷哼一声，不过是扯动了一下嘴角，便觉头痛欲裂，随即紧闭双眸，脑海中却闪过无数的画面，随着这些画面愈加地清晰，她再一次睁开双眸，撑着略显虚弱的身体，起身，许是起得过猛，有些许地晕眩。她低头，看着刺进胸口的箭羽，冷笑一声，一手按着胸口，另一只手用力一扯，便将刺进她胸口的箭羽拔出。“噗……”鲜血溅落在地上，她面色冷然，未曾皱眉，这样的疼痛，比起曾经的伤痛，不过尔尔，连忙抬手，用仅存的内力快速封住穴道，以防失血过多。她随即盘膝而坐，依照脑海中浮现的记忆，运功疗伤。左边隐隐有马蹄声传来，愈来愈近，她却不为所动，嘴角微扬，并无半分惧怕与惊慌，只管安心坐与原地，任由着马蹄践踏着地上的死尸，向她缓缓逼近。“凤傲天，你还没死？”男子低沉的声音响起，犹如一把历经磨砺，削铁如泥的宝剑，苍劲有力。李影并未理会，敏锐的直觉反应，此人是敌非友。果不其然，端坐于骏马之上的男子，见她不作应答，早先便知他狂妄残暴，如今死到临头，还敢如此张狂。“凤傲天，你以为你不说话，便能不死？”男子冷哼一声，剑眉划出锋芒，手中的宝剑出鞘，他轻轻一推，便向她直直刺去。凌厉的剑锋破空而出，力道之狠，速度之快。她紧闭的凤眸猝然睁开，一道寒光射过，身形随之后移，腾空而上，在那剑直抵胸口时，她弹指一挥，那刺来的剑便被她震成两半。用力过猛，扯动了伤口，她紧咬牙关，眸光碎出一抹冷光，足尖轻点，在那人怔愣时，飞身落入树林，外面的尸体皆是这具身体，凤傲天的亲信隐卫，如今，尽数被杀，便知当时的战况何等惨烈，凤傲天亦是身中一箭，箭上沾染剧毒，当场毙命。男子惊讶于他身中剧毒，还能有如此雄厚内力，他不信，今日还当真杀不了他，策马紧随其后，闯入树林，身后的士兵见状，连忙跟上，紧接着便听到百匹马蹄声纷沓而来。李影冷若冰霜的容颜，平静无波，她判断着马匹全部冲入树林，飞身旋落与高树之上，银色铠甲熠熠生辉，她眸光如炬，透着阴森，紧接着露出狰狞面容，朝天嘶吼。适才宁静的树林，此刻却传来凄厉的哀嚎声，阵阵寒风吹过，百匹马，纵使久经沙场，如今也按捺不住，拼命地抖动着马蹄，想要逃离这片树林。坐与马上的士兵皆是面面相觑，他们适才好像听到了狼嚎声，而且，还不止一匹。不安地四处张望，一名士兵待看到他们已经被狼群包围时，吓得尖叫一声，自马上掉了下去，当即吓晕，其他士兵见此情景，心生恐惧。“凤傲天，你以为招来狼群，便能逃脱吗？”男子见状，佯装镇定，勒紧马缰的手正细微的颤抖，泄露了他此刻的不安与恐惧。黑色铠甲透过阳光返照出冷森的光芒，他未料到凤傲天竟然有这等本事，能指挥狼群，狼群生性凶残，可以抵挡千军万马，如今，看来他难逃一死，即便是一死，他也要与凤傲天同归于尽。李影眉眼微弯，那双瞳眸射出狼性的嗜血幽光，“本王不过是想请朋友吃顿美餐罢了。”男子听闻，眸光黯淡，她话中的鄙夷与不屑，令一向自视甚高的他愠怒不已，何人不知他乃是骁勇善战的栖国大将军？而他，凤傲天，不过是个被娇惯坏的白目罢了，也胆敢对他口出狂言，随即，他大喝一声，自马上纵身一跃，宝剑散发着刺骨寒光，直直向她的面门刺去。端坐于马匹上的士兵见首领威武一跃，心中的惧怕减少了几分，不过，须臾间，便见一道黑影直直坠下，摔落在地上，猛吐一口鲜血，一双眸子不可置信地抬头仰望着那负手而立的肃然之人，他手中的剑已经刺入自己的胸口。他还未说出只言片语，便见她扬声狼嚎，便有数十匹狼泛着阴森恐怖的绿光，张开獠牙，陡然间扑了过去，撕咬着他已无法动弹的身体。“啊！”凄厉的惨叫回荡与树林中，转瞬便淹没在狼群兴奋的噬咬与分裂中，适才还威风凛凛，嚣张叫嚣的将军，此刻却变成了狼群的美食。“将军！”士兵见状，惊恐万状，还未反应，顿觉颈项处一痛，漫天落叶飞花，嫩绿的树叶幻化成锋利的飞镖，刺进他们咽喉。“噗咚！”此刻，眼前的士兵们如今已经变成死尸，纷纷自马上跌落与地上。剩余的狼群兴奋地仰天嚎叫着扑向断气的死尸，浓烈的血腥味笼罩与树林内，比起树林之外那些躺着的隐卫，他们顷刻间便已尸骨无存。银色铠甲此刻透着深如骨髓的慑人寒冷，高树之上的她迎风而立，漠视着眼前一切，俊美如月的容颜，沾染着斑斑血迹，冷若冰霜，直至狼群蚕食殆尽，她轻吹口哨，一匹雪白骏马飞奔而来。李影轻盈落于骏马之上，一朵粉色花瓣落于掌心，她拈花一笑，似阳春白雪，将她一身的戾气化去，独留一片瑰丽娇颜。“出来。”她收敛笑意，手中的花瓣随风离去。两道黑影随即落下，同样冷漠如常，这等场景早已司空见惯，血腥凶残对于他们的主子来说，不过是乐趣罢了。“回营。”不必多问，便已心知肚明，李影策马飞驰出树林，朝着右面而去。循着脑中的记忆，她顺利回到驻扎与五里之外的军营，营中将领连忙前来迎驾，李影不过是淡淡扫过他们的面容，便知他们的心思，她神色莫辨，飞身落马，径自回了自己帐中。“王爷，您总算回来了，让奴好生担心。”李影刚步入营帐，一股呛人的香粉扑面而来，她不悦地蹙眉，便见一团青影向她怀中飞扑而来。她从不喜与人碰触，尤其还是这香气呛鼻的怪物，还未等他靠近，她手掌一挥，人已应声倒地。“滚！”她面色阴沉，脚步不停，低喝道。那青影不顾身上疼痛，屁股开花，自地上翻滚起来，本欲再去黏上，这一冰冷的“滚”字，吓得他浑身一颤，乖巧地退了出去。帐内除左她，并无他人，她卸下身上的繁重，长衫玉立，径自净面之后，便卧于软榻，闭目养神。时光流转，将她带入她曾经的世界。她是狼女，喝狼奶长大，狼群中为伍，在她的意识中，除了掠夺便是厮杀，如此，便养成了她凉薄的性子。如若不是他将她从狼群中带出，她从来不知原来自己与狼不同，可是，他教会自己的却是无情的杀戮，将她困与黑暗地狱，至死方休。她生来便是别人的影子，李影李影，离开了他，影子也不复存在。她从未想过自己还会活着，而且，还重生在这样一个世界，有着如此的身份。凤傲天，年仅十四岁便成为凤国的摄政王，生性残暴，杀人解尸，无恶不作。不过，这或许是她们唯一的相同之处，那便是双手沾满鲜血。不同的是，她从不知情为何物，她向来冷酷无情。而她，凤傲天，世人皆知他残暴淫虐，却不知她所背负的种种，明明是金枝玉叶，却以龙子示人，扭曲的世界观，注定她嗜杀成性，残暴不仁；她视男人为玩物，只因心中深埋的那人已经仙逝，她无法排解心中的思念与愁苦，只能用最极端的方法换得短暂的欢愉。李影小憩片刻，睁开双眸，天色已暗，她自软榻上起身，斗转星移，她既然重生，便不想再做旁人的影子，她的命运由她主宰。“王爷，奴才伺候您梳洗。”帐外守职的太监小心询问，尖细的声音传入帐内，直抵她耳内。自她活着归来，整个军营便陷入沉寂恐慌之中，这军营离她围困之地，不过五里，却无人前来支援，可见，这营中想她死之人比比皆是，只可惜，她并未死成，而那些暗中害她之人，怕是要生不如死，她不是善类，向来睚眦必报。她素手一挥，帐内烛光摇曳，映衬着她冷漠如霜的容颜，李影徐步行至铜镜前，打量着如今的模样，束胸的平坦，稳健的高挑身材，清秀俊美的容貌，凤眸冷沉，自幼的历练，凤傲天俨然将自己当成男子，举手投足间亦是难掩的英气逼人。她对镜默念，今日起，李影已死，她是凤傲天，凤国的摄政王。“进来。”凤傲天冷然转身，端坐于榻上，面色沉凝，不带一丝温度。太监垂首入内，行礼道，“王爷，奴才伺候您梳洗。”“嗯。”凤傲天有一顺是要撵人的，但，碍于她如今的身份，便作罢，任由眼前的太监服侍，此人乃是冯公公离京之前特意指派与她，算是可信。距离营帐一里之外的密林中，月光透过树林，将隐藏与树下二人的影子拉地极长。“她不是中毒了吗？怎会活着回来？”低沉的声音疑惑不解。“我也奇怪，每日我与摄政王亲近时，她便会沾染上我身上的毒粉，否则，依着她的武功，他们怎会轻易得手？”浓烈的香粉充斥着四周。“青衣，事情到如此地步，且不能半途而废。”男子拍着他的肩膀，提醒着他。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－亲耐哒们，柠檬新文《卿本无赖之驸马不好惹》求收藏！同类型女强爽文！世人皆知，大炤国几百年出了个镇国公主，娶公主者，得半壁江山。试问，谁敢娶？传闻，镇国公主亲率三千铁骑，讨伐篡位逆贼，屠城三日，为胞弟夺了皇位，因杀伐太重，煞气缠身，乃不祥之人……传闻，镇国公主长相吓人，身高七尺，五大三粗，野蛮粗犷，乃凶恶之相……传闻，镇国公主出嫁三次，驸马皆死于非命，乃克夫之命……如此凶恶霸道野蛮的公主，谁有命娶？当闭关三年出来的楚凌昭听到这传闻之后，怒了！楚玉轩，你敢造谣败坏我的名声！于是乎，镇国公主开始了洗冤之路，耍起了流氓……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/yetaicanbao/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Volume 1 Regency Storm 001 She is a wolf girl. The setting sun is like blood, and blood fills the sky. The blood-flowing grassland echoes the setting sun, with a red light. Occasionally, there are a few wails of wild geese. It was originally an inaccessible place, but now it is indeed littered with corpses. It is shocking to look at it at a glance. Li Ying suddenly felt weak all over, the pain that penetrated his bones spread all over his body, and his nose was filled with the strong smell of blood. She was always alert, especially when faced with danger. He opened his eyes suddenly, and his dark eyes burst into sharp cold light like ice souls. A large area of ​​red came into view, with wreckage scattered everywhere and blood flowing like a river. Where is this? Is it hell? The corners of her mouth twitched slightly, if it was really hell, it would be better than purgatory on earth. \"Yeah.\" She groaned, but she just twitched the corner of her mouth, and she felt a splitting headache. Then she closed her eyes tightly, but countless pictures flashed through her mind. As these pictures became clearer, she opened her eyes again, supported her slightly weak body, and stood up. Maybe she got up too hard and was a little dizzy. She lowered her head and looked at the arrow feathers that had pierced her chest. She sneered, pressed her chest with one hand, and pulled hard with the other hand to pull out the arrow feathers that had penetrated her chest. \"Pfft...\" Blood spattered on the ground. Her face was cold and she never frowned. This kind of pain was worse than the previous injuries. However, Er Er quickly raised her hands and used her remaining internal strength to quickly seal the acupuncture points to prevent excessive blood loss. She then sat cross-legged and performed exercises to heal her injuries according to the memories that came to her mind. There was a faint sound of horse hooves coming from the left, getting closer and closer, but she remained unmoved. The corner of her mouth was raised slightly, without any fear or panic. She just sat there peacefully, letting the horse's hooves trample the dead bodies on the ground, slowly approaching her. \"Feng Aotian, are you not dead yet?\" The man's deep voice sounded, like a sword that has been sharpened and sharpened like clay, vigorous and powerful. Li Ying ignored him and reacted with a keen intuition that this person was an enemy rather than a friend. Sure enough, the man sitting on the horse saw that she didn't respond. He had known earlier that he was arrogant and cruel, but now that he was about to die, he dared to be so arrogant. \"Feng Aotian, do you think you won't die if you don't speak?\" The man snorted coldly, his sword eyebrows drew a sharp edge, the sword in his hand was unsheathed, he pushed it gently, and stabbed straight at her. The sharp sword edge shot out of the air with fierce force and fast speed. Her closed phoenix eyes suddenly opened, and a cold light shot through her. She then moved back and soared into the air. When the sword reached her chest, she flicked her fingers, and the sword she stabbed broke into two halves. She used too much force and pulled the wound. She gritted her teeth, a cold light broke out in her eyes, and she tapped her toes. When the man was stunned, he flew into the woods. The corpses outside were all of this body. Now, all of Feng Aotian's trusted guards were killed, so you know how tragic the battle was at that time. Feng Aotian was also hit by an arrow, which was contaminated with poison, and died on the spot. The man was surprised that he had such strong internal strength even though he was poisoned. He didn't believe that he really couldn't kill him today. He followed him on horseback and broke into the woods. Seeing this, the soldiers behind him hurriedly followed. Then he heard the sound of the hoofbeats of hundreds of horses approaching. Li Ying's face was as cold as ice, calm and calm. She judged that the horses all rushed into the woods and flew down above the tall trees. Her silver armor shone brightly. Her eyes were like torches, revealing a gloomy look. Then she revealed a ferocious face and roared towards the sky. The woods that were peaceful just now are now filled with shrill wails, and gusts of cold wind are blowing by. Hundreds of horses, even though they have been on the battlefield for a long time, cannot hold back anymore, and they are shaking their hooves desperately, trying to escape from the woods. The soldiers sitting on the horse looked at each other in confusion. They seemed to have heard the howling of wolves just now, and there were more than one. Looking around uneasily, one soldier screamed in fright when he saw that they were surrounded by wolves. He fell off his horse and fainted immediately. The other soldiers saw this scene and were frightened. \"Feng Aotian, do you think you can escape by attracting the wolves?\" Seeing this, the man pretended to be calm. The hand that tightened the horse's rein was trembling slightly, revealing his uneasiness and fear at the moment. The black armor reflected the cold light through the sunlight. He did not expect that Feng Aotian would have such ability to command the wolves. The wolves were ferocious in nature and could withstand thousands of troops. Now, it seemed that he could not escape death. Even if he died, he and Feng Aotian would die together. Li Ying's eyebrows were slightly curved, and her pupils shone with a wolf-like bloodthirsty light, \"I just want to treat my friends to a nice meal.\" The man's eyes darkened when he heard this. The contempt and disdain in her words made him angry because he always thought highly of himself. Who didn't know that he was a brave and capable general of Qi State? And he, Feng Aotian, was just a spoiled white-eye, and he dared to speak arrogant words to him. Then, he shouted loudly, jumped from his horse, and the sword radiated a biting cold light and stabbed straight towards her face. The soldier sitting on the horse saw the leader making a mighty leap, and the fear in his heart was reduced a bit. However, in a moment, he saw a black shadow falling straight down, falling to the ground, spitting out a mouthful of blood, and looking up at the solemn man standing with his hands behind his hands in disbelief. The sword in his hand had already pierced his chest. Before he could say a word, he saw her howling like a wolf, and dozens of wolves glowed with an eerie green light, opened their fangs, and suddenly pounced on him, biting his unable to move body. \"Ah!\" The shrill scream echoed in the woods, and was instantly submerged in the excited bites and divisions of the wolves. The general who was majestic and arrogant just now became the delicacy of the wolves. \"General!\" When the soldiers saw this, they were horrified. Before they could react, they suddenly felt a pain in their necks. Fallen leaves and flowers filled the sky, and the green leaves turned into sharp darts and pierced their throats. \"Puff!\" At this moment, the soldiers in front of him had turned into corpses and fell to the ground one after another. The remaining wolves looked up to the sky and howled excitedly and pounced on the dying corpse.", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}